WEBVTT

00:17.455 --> 00:24.497
I was the one who was lost in the gray, a ship in the

00:24.557 --> 00:32.940
dark, afraid of the day. You were the harbor, the

00:33.060 --> 00:44.483
only truth, my anchor in this crazy youth. But an

00:44.683 --> 00:49.510
anchor's made to hold. Hold you fast

00:50.710 --> 00:56.672
It was never meant to make you last I'm here

00:56.692 --> 01:04.175
holding you down Afraid that you would leave

01:04.235 --> 01:09.096
this town But you were never meant to stay

01:12.738 --> 01:21.263
And I was just the heavy stone, the one you had to

01:21.303 --> 01:28.727
leave alone. Now I'm the anchor, and you're the

01:28.827 --> 01:30.227
sail.

02:02.620 --> 02:09.748
I'm not a stone I'm by your side We're in this

02:09.808 --> 02:19.375
current On the same tide I'm not the anchor I'm

02:19.415 --> 02:27.840
the wind, the one who helps your journey begin.

02:27.860 --> 02:33.363
We're not an anchor and a sail. We're just a ship

02:33.383 --> 02:37.845
that will prevail. We are the compass. We are the

02:37.905 --> 02:41.387
map. We're finding our way back.

02:45.529 --> 02:50.713
Cause you were never meant to stay You were the

02:50.853 --> 02:57.198
sail Meant to fly away But I was never a heavy

02:57.278 --> 03:05.824
stone You never had to be alone I'm not the anchor

03:06.225 --> 03:10.008
You're not the sail

03:11.059 --> 03:25.673
We're in this storm and we will prevail

03:25.974 --> 03:32.440
We will prevail

03:32.500 --> 03:34.442
We're coming home

03:38.381 --> 03:40.447
We're coming home

